16:21:46  == Your files
16:21:46  ClaudeOS can't open macOS's own files: FileVault, which most Macs have on, locks them to macOS. So setup copies
16:21:46  the folders you choose onto a drive called ClaudeOS that both systems open; macOS keeps its own copies. What
16:21:46  you save on that drive in ClaudeOS is in macOS too, and you can send more later (run setup again).
